er skew, but it's a constant-factor improvement, not a transformation. The =
integer-position encoding remains the size-optimal choice for raw storage; =
BWT's value continues to be the queryable compressed form (rank/select, FM-=
index), not bit-minimization. If the operational picture justifies keeping =
ops in bitmask-algebra on an SM-resident structure, BWT is fine and split-L=
+Q is a sensible default within it. If the value being optimized for is raw=
