<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Microbenchmark numbers: L1 hit latency is roughly 22-40 cycles on B=
lackwell and 30-40 cycles on Hopper/H200. So a single chart load from share=
d memory is ~30 cycles, not 4. <span class=3D"inline-flex" data-state=3D"cl=
osed"><a href=3D"https://www.emergentmind.com/topics/blackwell-gpu-architec=
