<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Resolution: <strong>designated rule</strong> (=3D index 3, per C2).=
 Failure propagation through composition uses O(1) <code class=3D"bg-text-2=
00/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wra=
p rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">eq(result, failure)</code>. Th=
e fast-short-circuit advantage of exceptions is partially recovered because=
