<ul class=3D"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:l=
ast-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-co=
l gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
G=C3=B6del exclusive: commutativity, multiplicative homomorphism, unique fa=
ctorization.</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
de Bruijn exclusive: substitution composition, index-shift action, presheaf=
 structure.</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
Shared: integer-valued, unique decoding, <strong>S_=E2=88=9E-symmetric on n=
atural generators</strong>.</li>
