<h3 class=3D"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">The unifyi=
ng structure</h3>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">The polynomial ring <strong>=E2=84=A4[x=E2=82=81, x=E2=82=82, =E2=
=80=A6]</strong> over countably many indeterminates carries both:</p>
<ul class=3D"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:l=
