</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What this =
picks</h3>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Storage</strong>: combinatory logic =E2=80=94 closed terms,=
 no variables, every rule is a fixed-arity operadic operation. Fits the fre=
e-symmetric-operad cleanly.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>API</strong>: de Bruijn lambda (or HOTRS) =E2=80=94 variabl=
