<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
The grammar's LFP becomes the initial algebra of the operad.</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
The topos's internal logic comes from presheaf semantics.</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
The grammar-as-ISA correspondence is the standard operad =E2=86=94 microcod=
e pairing.</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">The polynomial-ring view gives the algebra; the operadic view gives=
