 vertex selection in the meta-associahedron over governance disciplines, wi=
th rotations to alternative refinement orderings being admissible.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">This also retroactively explains why M3's constraint-solving felt n=
atural rather than ad-hoc: the five force categories (topos/charter/operati=
