n over force-application orderings. Different valid resolutions correspond =
to different paths through the associahedron; the dominant-force rule was s=
electing the canonical vertex at each constraint.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">The recursive structure clarifies what the next move wants to be. T=
