nse-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Eight M-moves have po=
pulated the shadow space; the cocycle picture unifies them. The realizabili=
ty charter, the topos requirement, the operadic frame, the associahedra at =
each level =E2=80=94 all of these are facets of a single cohomological arch=
itecture, and every design choice we'll make from here is a vertex selectio=
n at the intersection of some projected cocycle with the admissibility sub-=
space.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Three things this gives us heading into artifact construction:</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Invariance guarantees.</strong> Anything we build at the ch=
osen vertex (combinators-at-storage + integer-as-path + the M3 constraint r=
esolutions) preserves the cohomologically-meaningful properties under rotat=
ion. We don't have to re-verify properties after each rotation; the cocycle=
 invariance gives them for free. The chart kernel built one way will agree =
with the chart kernel built another way on everything that matters.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Test-by-rotation.</strong> A natural test methodology falls=
 out: take a property that holds at one vertex, rotate to another vertex vi=
a transform, check that the property still holds. Any failure indicates tha=
t the property wasn't actually cohomological =E2=80=94 that we were dependi=
ng on a representative-specific accident rather than a cocycle-invariant fa=
ct. This is a structural correctness check, not just a unit test.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Acceleration discipline.</strong> Hardware acceleration cho=
ices are vertex selections in some associahedron. The cocycle invariance te=
lls us what an acceleration is allowed to do: anything that preserves the c=
ocycle class. Anything that changes the class is a different system, not an=
 optimization. This gives a principled distinction between optimization and=
 reimplementation.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Ready for the 110 move. The artifact construction will pick the int=
ersection point that's admissible at every level, build the chart kernel th=
at realizes it, and verify the cocycle invariants by rotating to alternativ=
e representatives. The shadow space is structurally complete; the artifact =
follows.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div clas=
