<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>S's syndrome under Hamming(7, 4) decoding is precisely the =
axis-signature 111 =E2=80=94 the triadic-full position, which is M11's sign=
ature.</strong> This is not coincidence. Position 7 (label 111) is the uniq=
