 S's truth table has its single 1 at exactly that position, so its Hamming =
syndrome IS that position's F_2=C2=B3 label.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">S, M11, and position 111 are the same structural locus expressed in=
 three languages: polynomial degree, axis-signature, and error position.</p=
