<h3 class=3D"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Our move h=
istory is NOT a Hamming codeword</h3>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Our actual move history populates 6 of 7 axis-signatures (everythin=
