<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Hamming(7, 4) has NO weight-6 codewords (the spectrum is {0, 3, 4, =
7}). So our move history sits in the error zone. The syndrome is 001 =E2=80=
