, q)</code> =E2=80=94 creates new chart cell, advances index. Two axes, no =
compute.</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
<code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-dange=
r-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">var(na=
me)</code> =E2=80=94 wraps a name in VAR_MARK. New cell at new time.</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
chart growth via hash-consing (M5) =E2=80=94 the chart's monotonic accumula=
tion.</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>DATA + COMPUTE</strong> (manipulates data via morphism, no =
