Set N =E2=89=A4 16 or 32; enumerate; verify.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Pattern B =E2=80=94 Use group orbits, not raw elements.</st=
rong> Instead of 32768 state vectors at Level 3, enumerate A_8 orbits =E2=
=80=94 there are far fewer, and each orbit characterizes a structurally mea=
ningful class.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Pattern C =E2=80=94 Use combinatorial structure of named ob=
jects.</strong> The Stasheff polytope K_m has exactly C_{m-1} vertices. Enu=
merating compositional strategies at scale m means enumerating those vertic=
