<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>Pattern E =E2=80=94 Reduce to isomorphism classes.</strong>=
 Many "different" choices are equivalent up to gauge transformation. Enumer=
ate isomorphism classes (small finite set), pick a representative for each.=
