M32 implementation has <strong>semantic V=E2=82=84-twinning</strong> (opera=
tions play V=E2=82=84-rotated roles)</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
M32 implementation does NOT have <strong>structural V=E2=82=84-symmetry</st=
rong> (engagement profiles don't rotate)</li>
<li class=3D"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">=
The 13 cocycle invariance tests verified output equivalence, which is neces=
sary but insufficient</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]"><strong>What honest forward work looks like</strong>:</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Option A =E2=80=94 Refactor toward axis-symmetric infrastructure. M=
ake D, C, S, W structurally parallel (each a namespace with same operations=
 and same mutation model). This is roughly M14-scale work and would make V=
=E2=82=84-rotation operationally manifest.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Option B =E2=80=94 Downgrade the cotype claims from "V=E2=82=84-rot=
ations" to "analogous patterns." Honest, low-cost, but weakens the symmetry=
 story that motivated the whole architecture.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">Option C =E2=80=94 Add a meta-protocol where operations expose thei=
r engagement explicitly (<code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 bor=
der-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py=
-px text-[0.9rem]">op.engagement() =E2=86=92 set</code>), and the runtime c=
an apply V=E2=82=84 swaps via <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.=
5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px=
-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">op.v4_rotate(swap) =E2=86=92 op'</code>. Doesn't fi=
x the underlying asymmetry but lets the runtime work with V=E2=82=84 explic=
itly.</p>
<p class=3D"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading=
-[1.7]">The architecture's symmetry story is currently at the specification=
 level, not the implementation level. Closing that gap is real work =E2=80=
=94 but the audit identifies exactly what work it is and where the gap live=
