rap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">_history</code> and may allo=
cate through <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-3=
00 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.=
